{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0023_1000_009rit", "source_sha256": "f298acfbaf8e497f40e6846a066fb99f4ea1a854cf06493e661af9cd313933da", "ja": "フリフリドレスに、新妻ルック……。\n今回のお仕事、私のガラじゃないのばっかりでしたね。", "zh": "荷叶边洋装，还有新婚妻子的打扮……\n这次的工作，有好多不适合我的装扮呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0023_1001_p", "source_sha256": "844ffa2d90169db4b5dcce3803c117af1eef22b915aa4ecd5493d67a80d40a3a", "ja": "そうか？\nドレスも新妻姿も、律子はノリノリに見えたけど。", "zh": "会吗？\n穿上洋装和新婚妻子打扮时，律子看起来都很来劲啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0023_1002_009rit", "source_sha256": "b514cfe0d6c784572d3be35beaa8ee716d7bc52426b9ac967d2fe570e581c50c", "ja": "気のせいです。気・の・せ・い。\n……うう～、早く忘れてくださいよぉ！", "zh": "那是错觉，错、觉。\n呜呜～拜托你赶快忘掉啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0023_1003_p", "source_sha256": "2727f266cc3fa57d6a2d4ebeb56341579e57a809a412bb1c8ce7aa6726f6062f", "ja": "そんなに否定しなくてもいいんじゃないか？\n特に新妻ルックは、大好評だって聞いてるけど……。", "zh": "用不着那么极力否定吧？\n特别是新婚妻子的打扮，我听说大受好评啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0023_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "fc6aca40188ae2fffa5944cc8975afd799d25fbcdc98680a2c56dfa010110b73", "ja": "いやいやいやいや。\n私の中では、すでに黒歴史というか……。", "zh": "不不不不。\n该说那在我心中，已经成为黑历史了吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0023_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6b288635fe1564c6d139105d8c6cfa768a6186f6f381feb3de47ec813d10d9b4", "ja": "いいじゃないか。かわいくてしっかり者のお嫁さんは、\n男なら誰だって憧れるって。", "zh": "不是挺好的吗？只要是男人，\n都很向往有个可爱又认真的新娘啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0023_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "7d1fcc0de335526e69dc6ec8993c59b4eeeee19f5e425d281b9e8dce400c332d", "ja": "か、からかわないでください！　だいたい、私が目指し\nてるのは、お嫁さんじゃなくてトップアイドルです！", "zh": "别、别闹我了！\n再说，我的目标可不是新娘，而是顶尖偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0023_1007_009rit", "source_sha256": "575caaf7dd3921a7682793812cd61ad3d604c074cab86fb043e0b57cedbcbff7", "ja": "イメージ戦略、っていうならわかりますけど……。\nまずは基本のアイドルとしての力を身につけないと！", "zh": "虽然我知道这是形象策略的一环……\n但还是得先把基本的偶像实力培养起来才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0023_1008_p", "source_sha256": "80f25935e47742d33b14518530e76b258c40fd5581dc8f928a9462cda322b304", "ja": "なるほど。確かに律子のいう通りだ……。\nよし！", "zh": "原来如此，确实正如律子所说……\n好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0023_1009_p", "source_sha256": "e0a9d368c5c9930bba609cc68b46568a5a4b91e4ad3340dec1b9e1fd69aa578e", "ja": "目指すは、歌って踊れるお嫁さんアイドル。\nこれでいこう、律子！", "zh": "目标是能歌善舞的新娘偶像。\n就走这条路线吧，律子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0023_1010_009rit", "source_sha256": "56ddbf9838f1c8ee205c1d277dd8723baed392aee936951f38b2120ce4333bb6", "ja": "いーきーまーせーんーっ！\nもうっ、{$P$}のばかぁ！", "zh": "我～才～不～要～！\n真是的，{$P$}这个笨蛋！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
